  "summary": "",
  "preview": "",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">各有关院系，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:24.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">根据国家留学基金委有关工作安排，现启动2027年艺术类人才培养特别项目（项目制）实施工作，我校作为项目单位须按要求提交项目申请，参阅<span class=\"MsoHyperlink\" style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=routebfaf9f0f6d2d4e61a289dc12dd4ca9d4\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.csc.edu.cn/chuguo/s/4274</a></span></span>。项目申报有关要求及安排如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:24.1pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">一、艺术类人才培养特别项目简介</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">艺术类人才培养特别项目采取“先立项，后选派”的办法,</span></span></span> <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">由</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项目实施单位向国家留学基金委申报项目，国家留学基金委组织专家评审，确定资助项目及各项目选派类别与规模；项目实施单位按照获批项目及人选条件选拔推荐人选，经国家留学基金委审核录取后派出。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">申报项目应结合国家需要，着眼于国内研究起步晚、发展薄弱、与国际水平有较大差距的艺术领域，强调精准选派和结果导向；聚焦交叉学科、新兴学科、能够培养原创性、创造力或创新思维的艺术学专业；应建立艺术人才培养的长效机制，形成自主、连贯、规模化的定向选拔、派出和就业的全链条培养模式。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">国外合作单位须为世界一流院校或在艺术类人才培养方面具有优势的院校、机构。中外双方应签有尚在有效期内的合作协议，有一定前期执行基础。合作协议应与所申报项目直接相关，明确双方合作领域或专业、选派人员的身份、培养方案或学制、双方权责等。合作协议的生效不得以获得本项目资助为前提。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">我校艺术类人才培养特别项目主要选派类别为联合培养博士研究生、联合培养硕士研究生。各类别留学期限、资助期限参照当年《国家留学基金资助出国留学人员选派简章》具体要求。留学期限应根据拟留学单位学制、外方录取通知（或正式邀请信）中列明的留学时间确定。如留学单位收取学费，项目实施单位应积极争取外方免除全部或部分学费，亦或多方筹集配套经费支付学费，应详细说明国内外经费来源并提供相关证明材料。获批项目执行期为三年。项目执行期间选派名额、选派类别、选派专业、留学国别、留学单位原则上不予调整。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">《2027年艺术类人才培养特别项目实施指南》详见<span class=\"MsoHyperlink\" style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=route9e803c1042e9400bb4c02e6e88c67fbe\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.csc.edu.cn/article/4275</a></span></span> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:24.1pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">二、所申报项目及外方合作单位数量</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:24.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:black\">每单位可申报</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Helvetica\",sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:black\">个项目；</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">外方合作单位数量没有限制，但要求项目实施单位与各外方合作单位均签有合作协议，并就艺术类人才培养特别项目申报协商达成一致。建议项目实施单位聚焦拟申报项目涉及的重点学科和外方单位的强项、特色学科，择优选择外方合作单位。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:24.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\" style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=route15f2760b89424d6a8dd623cef62ec887\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">项目申报材料及说明</a></span></span></span></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（https://www.csc.edu.cn/article/4276 ）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:black\">三、</span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项目申报及评审程序</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <table align=\"center\" class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none\"> \n  <tbody> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:170px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">时  间</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">申报及评审程序</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:170px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年9月14日</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">17</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">点前</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">校内拟申请本项目的单位，请于<b>9月14日17点前</b>将下列材料各一份交至研究生院培养办（李兆基科技大楼B220-2室）审核，并请同时提交下列材料电子版至研究生院邮箱：<span class=\"MsoHyperlink\" style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">wangyuping@tsinghua.edu.cn</a></span></span> 。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）申请书模板-艺术类人才培养特别项目（供单位内部项目选拔和申报准备用）（附件1）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）单位（校级）领导推荐意见（模板）（附件2）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）项目各方合作协议（</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">中英文，要求是执行中的有效期内协议，如只签了英文协议请自行翻译成中文版</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-indent:24.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">说明： 包括拟申报项目涉及的所有中外合作协议。如拟申报项目包含多个国内参与单位，须同时上传牵头单位与参与单位之间的项目申报确认材料（协议、公函等）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）项目管理办法（</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:black\">网上填写，应包含选派流程、人选标准、学生回国服务保障机制等，无须向国家留学基金委提交纸质材料。</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）项目配套经费说明（如有其它国内外经费来源或确定的经费分担机制）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:170px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年9月21日</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">研究生院暂定于<b>9月21日</b>组织校内专家评审，请各项目准备进行项目汇报（具体安排另行通知），经公示后确定推荐项目名单。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:170px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年10月10-15日</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">1.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项目实施单位主管部门按照单位内部选拔结果组织完成项目网上申报（<span class=\"MsoHyperlink\" style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=route3b5e7b6eec1e4fdbbcae0799d748c8a7\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">http://sa.csc.edu.cn</a>/project</span></span>），上传相关材料，并提交至国家留学基金委审核（含执行满3年申请继续资助项目）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">执行中项目单位对获批项目进行年度总结并按要求在平台提交项目年度执行报告</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:170px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年11月</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">国家留学基金委组织对各单位申报项目和执行满3年申请继续资助项目进行材料审核和专家评审，确定拟立项资助项目和拟继续资助项目。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:170px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年12月</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">通过国家公派留学管理信息平台公布立项结果</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:170px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2027</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年起</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">获批项目启动项目执行</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:414px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">备忘：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">第一批人员选拔基金委网申时间为2027年4月1-10日；第二批人员选拔基金委网申时间为2027年11月1-10日；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">人员选拔要求详见基金委网站艺术类人才培养特别项目专栏</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif\">&rarr;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">网址：<span class=\"MsoHyperlink\" style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=routebfaf9f0f6d2d4e61a289dc12dd4ca9d4\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.csc.edu.cn/chuguo/s/4<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif\">274</span></span></span></a></span></span> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n  </tbody> \n </table> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style